n from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：重（おも）かったでしょう。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：大変（たいへん）でしたね。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q12</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q12.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：いいですよ。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q13</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q13.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation. </p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：インターネットで探（さが）したら、どうですか。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：インターネットで探（さが）したら、いいですよ。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q14</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q14.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：すみません。今（いま）のどが痛（いた）いんです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q15</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q15.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：じゃ、お酒（さけ）は飲（の）まないほうがいいですよ。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：じゃ、今晩（こんばん）早（はや）く寝（ね）たほうがいいですよ。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q16</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q16.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：ちょっと、休憩（きゅうけい）しましょうか。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：そうだね。どこかで休（やす）もう。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q17</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q17.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation. </div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：わからないけど、食（た）べる？</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q18</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q18.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：えー！ほんと？それだけで。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q19</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q19.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：もう全部（ぜんぶ）使（つか）ってしまったんじゃないですか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q20</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q20.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Listen to the conversation from Ms. A and choose all the correct answers from Mr.B that match the conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：そこに置（お）いてありますよ。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：引（ひ）き出（だ）しにしまっておきましたよ。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">B：さっきカバンに入（い）れたでしょう。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q21</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\">Please choose one correct question for the following answer.\r\nA：今（いま）使（つか）っているという意味（いみ）です。</div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Q：使用中（しようちゅう）はどういう意味（いみ）ですか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q22</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\">Please choose one correct question for the following answer.\r\nA：はい、少（すこ）し話（はな）せます。</div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Q：日本語（にほんご）が話（はな）せますか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q23</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\">Please choose one correct question for the following answer.\r\nA：道（みち）に迷（まよ）ってしまったんです。</div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Q：どうしたんですか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q24</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\">Please choose one correct question for the following answer.\r\nA：約束（やくそく）の時間（じかん）に間（ま）に合（あ）わないかもしれません。</div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Q：道（みち）が込（こ）んでいますね。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q25</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\">Please choose one correct question for the following answer.\r\nA：今（いま）ダイエットをしているんです。</div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Q：どうして食（た）べないんですか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q26</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Look at the picture and select all the sentences that match the picture.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" src=\"../images/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q26.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">私（わたし）は田中（たなか）さんにチケットをもらいました。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">田中（たなか）さんは私（わたし）にチケットをくれました。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q27</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Look at the picture and select all the sentences that match the picture.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" src=\"../images/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q27.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">私（わたし）は彼（かれ）に花束（はなたば）をもらいました。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">彼（かれ）は私（わたし）に花束（はなたば）をくれました。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q28</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Look at the picture and select all the sentences that match the picture.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" src=\"../images/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q28.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">雪（ゆき）で電車（でんしゃ）が止（と）まりました。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">雪（ゆき）が降（ふ）ったとき、電車（でんしゃ）が止（と）まりました。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q29</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Look at the picture and select all the sentences that match the picture.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" src=\"../images/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q29.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">リンさんは来年（らいねん）国（くに）へ帰（かえ）るって言（い）ってたよ。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">リンさんは来年（らいねん）国（くに）へ帰（かえ）ると言（い）っていました。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q30</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Look at the picture and select all the sentences that match the picture.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" src=\"../images/tests/week_09-12/w9-12test_q30.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answers</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">ご飯（はん）を食（た）べながら、テレビを見（み）ます。</div><div class=\"akey-choice\">テレビを見（み）ながら、ご飯（はん）を食（た）べます。</div></div></div></div>",
